# Chefdclub project context

Read `PROJECT_BRIEF.md` in this repo (and `../chefdclub_backend/PROJECT_BRIEF.md` for full detail).

- **Migration:** Laravel → **Next.js** (website + modern admin) + **Node API**. Same **features and data**; **new UI**.
- **Paths:** Laravel `E:\chefdclub\laravel_code` · Frontend `E:\chefdclub\code\chefdclub_frontend` · Backend `E:\chefdclub\code\chefdclub_backend`.
- **Pattern:** Feature folders under `src/features/`; APIs via `src/lib/api/` (`ARCHITECTURE.md`).
- **Delivery:** Vertical slices with backend; wire forms and admin to real APIs as each module is ready.
